==Strategy==
Use 3-5 cheap meatshield for this stage. Capy only has a [[Single Attack]], so having a massive stack of meatshields is reccomended. Meatshields with a [[Survive]] ability such as [[Pogo Cat (Rare Cat)|Jiangshi Cat]] or [[Kyubey Cat (Rare Cat)|Kyubey Cat]] can be of use too. Having [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]] is extremely useful, due to their high resistance to Red enemies. As for the attackers, any good Anti-Red will suffice. Some useful options include [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Island Cat]], [[Thundia (Uber Rare Cat)|Thundia]], and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]]. As soon as the battle starts, get a Roe Cat out, then spam your meatshields until you have a good stack, then send out your attackers. Simple!

